  "Legionnaire Disease and Pontiac Fever" => "Legionnaires disease is a severe pneumonia caused by Legionella, while Pontiac fever is a milder flu-like illness from the same bacteria. Exposure to contaminated water systems is typical; pneumonia, confusion, low oxygen, or high fever requires urgent treatment.",
